@page "/isolation"

<PageTitle>Deja — per-component state isolation</PageTitle>

<h1>Isolation</h1>
<p class="lead">
    Two <code>TodoPanel</code> components, each inheriting <code>DejaComponentBase</code> and
    holding its own <code>Query&lt;T&gt;</code>. Refetch one and watch only that panel's render
    counter move: Deja state notifies a single attached listener — the component that owns it —
    so the other panel is not merely filtered out, it was never reachable.
</p>

<TodoPanel Title="Left" />
